  "short_description": "Non-canonical FirstPersonEmbodiment research layered on accepted CH9.6. S7 PackedScene/BoneAttachment hand visuals are accepted; S8 adds a real weighted ArrayMesh + Skin provider with named-bone retargeting onto the same canonical 17-bone pose skeleton.",
  "purpose": "Evaluate first-person articulated one/two-hand held-item presentation, third-person held-item visibility and secondary-hand support, catalogued item silhouettes, grip profiles, substitutable/resource-backed/skinned hand visuals, clothing-visible viewmodels and low-latency item selection without reopening frozen CH9.6 and without weakening authority over concrete item actions.",
