  "progress_note": "R2/S1-S6 remain accepted. S7 is now accepted from the operator Windows run on b82959d494f20f154e14e5c3b6391969cbaff6c3: S7 resource-backed hand visual provider PASS 31 assertions, S6 PASS 33, collision isolation PASS 30, performance PASS 10, graphical scene-load PASS 25 and final FirstPersonEmbodiment focused tests PASS. Both default PLAY and -HandVisualScene res://tests/fixtures/fpe_s7_authored_hand_visual.tscn launched successfully; the operator reported the visual behavior works correctly. S8 now adds SkinnedFirstPersonHandVisualProvider, SkinnedResourceConfigurableTwoHandFirstPersonEmbodiment and Fix16. The S8 fixture contains a real weighted ArrayMesh plus named Skin binds and explicit source-to-canonical bone mapping. S8 validates weight arrays, requires named binds, remaps Skin bind names/bone indices to the canonical Skeleton3D and explicitly binds MeshInstance3D.skeleton to that parent. S7 compatibility and the procedural fallback remain available. Accepted CH9.6 remains unchanged.",
  "last_accepted_checkpoint": "FPE-R2 S7 RESEARCH ACCEPTED: clean full focused suite on b82959d494f20f154e14e5c3b6391969cbaff6c3 including S7 provider 31 assertions and scene-load 25, plus successful default and resource-backed graphical launches; checkpoint docs/checkpoints/2026-08-12_FPE_R2_S7_ACCEPTED_RESOURCE_HAND_PROVIDER_RU.md; accepted CH9.6 base e547ba52a440e72cc02c6bbe449edaf160bae7ab remains frozen",
  "next_stage": "Operator updates the detached FPE worktree and reruns RUN_FPE_RESEARCH_TESTS.ps1. New mandatory gate: FPE R2 S8 skinned hand retarget provider: PASS. Existing S2-S7, collision, performance and scene-load gates must remain clean. Then run default PLAY to confirm no regression, followed by PLAY -SkinnedHandScene res://tests/fixtures/fpe_s8_skinned_hand_visual.tscn and verify HUD reports S8 REQUESTED with L/R RESOURCE_SKINNED_RETARGETED while one/two-hand poses, third-person support and zero-stall hotbar behavior remain unchanged. The S8 fixture proves weighted skin binding and named-bone retargeting, not final production hand art or arbitrary rest-space conversion.",
